BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.5 Tm /F1 9.7 Tf 13.2 TL (HR\222s assessment is that the attrition reflects a combination of an intense operational period, a competitive external) Tj T* (market and individual career decisions, compounded by the uncertainty customarily associated with a sale) Tj T* (process. While the concentration of departures in the authentication and key-management teams is notable, we) Tj T* (have not identified a systemic people-management issue. The internal-alignment theme is being noted to the) Tj T* (General Counsel for awareness; it is a matter of professional judgement on the handling of the October event) Tj T* (rather than a conduct concern.) Tj T* ET
